<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="だから僕は音楽を辞めた"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="所以我放弃了音乐"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="ヨルシカ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Yorushika"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="夜鹿"/><amll:meta key="album" value="だから僕は音楽を辞めた"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPA651904585"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1357953768"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="000rIBew065PCy"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1648877323"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="103079805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="hanyu200"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>n-buna</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:01.663"><div begin="1.450" end="4:01.663"><p begin="1.450" end="3.067" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1.450" end="1.597">考</span><span begin="1.597" end="1.744">え</span><span begin="1.744" end="1.891">た</span><span begin="1.891" end="2.038">っ</span><span begin="2.038" end="2.185">て</span><span begin="2.185" end="2.332">わ</span><span begin="2.332" end="2.479">か</span><span begin="2.479" end="2.626">ら</span><span begin="2.626" end="2.773">な</span><span begin="2.773" end="2.920">い</span><span begin="2.920" end="3.067">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想过之后依然搞不懂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan ga e ta tte wa ka ra na i shi</span></p><p begin="3.242" end="4.967" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.242" end="3.479">青</span><span begin="3.479" end="3.737">空</span><span begin="3.737" end="3.881">の</span><span begin="3.881" end="4.081">下、</span><span begin="4.081" end="4.351">君</span><span begin="4.351" end="4.497">を</span><span begin="4.497" end="4.606">待</span><span begin="4.606" end="4.715">っ</span><span begin="4.715" end="4.967">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在蔚蓝的天空下等待着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">a o zo ra no shi ta, ki mi o ma tta</span></p><p begin="5.159" end="8.481" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.159" end="5.430">風</span><span begin="5.430" end="5.519">が</span><span begin="5.519" end="5.632">吹</span><span begin="5.632" end="5.787">い</span><span begin="5.787" end="5.868">た</span><span begin="5.868" end="6.162">正</span><span begin="6.162" end="6.474">午、</span><span begin="6.578" end="6.800">昼</span><span begin="6.800" end="6.961">下</span><span begin="6.961" end="7.150">が</span><span begin="7.150" end="7.254">り</span><span begin="7.254" end="7.355">を</span><span begin="7.355" end="7.483">抜</span><span begin="7.483" end="7.572">け</span><span begin="7.572" end="7.692">出</span><span begin="7.692" end="7.787">す</span><span begin="7.787" end="8.038">想</span><span begin="8.038" end="8.481">像</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吹着风的正午 午后的思绪逐渐飘离</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ka ze ga fu i ta sho u go, hi ru sa ga ri o nu ke da su so u zo u</span></p><p begin="8.573" end="10.811" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.573" end="8.660">ね</span><span begin="8.660" end="8.826">ぇ、</span><span begin="8.999" end="9.128">こ</span><span begin="9.128" end="9.267">れ</span><span begin="9.267" end="9.387">か</span><span begin="9.387" end="9.515">ら</span><span begin="9.515" end="9.635">ど</span><span begin="9.635" end="9.741">う</span><span begin="9.741" end="9.897">な</span><span begin="9.897" end="10.010">る</span><span begin="10.010" end="10.119">ん</span><span begin="10.119" end="10.245">だ</span><span begin="10.245" end="10.355">ろ</span><span begin="10.355" end="10.470">う</span><span begin="10.470" end="10.811">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐，今后该如何是好呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nee, ko re ka ra do u na run da ro u ne</span></p><p begin="10.969" end="12.707" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.969" end="11.165">進</span><span begin="11.165" end="11.271">め</span><span begin="11.271" end="11.523">方</span><span begin="11.523" end="11.781">教</span><span begin="11.781" end="11.908">わ</span><span begin="11.908" end="11.996">ら</span><span begin="11.996" end="12.126">な</span><span begin="12.126" end="12.222">い</span><span begin="12.222" end="12.279">ん</span><span begin="12.279" end="12.409">だ</span><span begin="12.409" end="12.707">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向前迈进的方法没有学过啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">su su me ka ta o so wa ra na in da yo</span></p><p begin="13.041" end="16.376" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.041" end="13.324">君</span><span begin="13.324" end="13.450">の</span><span begin="13.450" end="13.553">目</span><span begin="13.553" end="13.677">を</span><span begin="13.677" end="13.816">見</span><span begin="13.816" end="14.500">た</span> <span begin="14.500" end="14.772">何</span><span begin="14.772" end="14.911">も</span><span begin="14.911" end="15.045">言</span><span begin="15.045" end="15.157">え</span><span begin="15.157" end="15.279">ず</span><span begin="15.279" end="15.487">僕</span><span begin="15.487" end="15.753">は</span><span begin="15.753" end="15.845">歩</span><span begin="15.845" end="16.001">い</span><span begin="16.001" end="16.376">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着你的双眼 什么也没说的就走了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ki mi no me o mi ta na ni mo i e zu bo ku wa a ru i ta</span></p><p begin="32.133" end="33.819" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.133" end="32.401">考</span><span begin="32.401" end="32.596">え</span><span begin="32.596" end="32.729">た</span><span begin="32.729" end="32.831">っ</span><span begin="32.831" end="32.924">て</span><span begin="32.924" end="33.052">わ</span><span begin="33.052" end="33.166">か</span><span begin="33.166" end="33.300">ら</span><span begin="33.300" end="33.412">な</span><span begin="33.412" end="33.505">い</span><span begin="33.505" end="33.819">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想过之后依然搞不懂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan ga e ta tte wa ka ra na i shi</span></p><p begin="33.891" end="35.719" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.891" end="34.202">青</span><span begin="34.202" end="34.458">春</span><span begin="34.458" end="34.609">な</span><span begin="34.609" end="34.712">ん</span><span begin="34.712" end="34.836">て</span><span begin="34.836" end="34.956">つ</span><span begin="34.956" end="35.081">ま</span><span begin="35.081" end="35.225">ら</span><span begin="35.225" end="35.310">な</span><span begin="35.310" end="35.416">い</span><span begin="35.416" end="35.719">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">青春什么的无聊透顶</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">se i shun nan te tsu ma ra na i shi</span></p><p begin="35.856" end="39.270" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.856" end="36.035">辞</span><span begin="36.035" end="36.174">め</span><span begin="36.174" end="36.294">た</span><span begin="36.294" end="36.461">筈</span><span begin="36.461" end="36.659">の</span><span begin="36.659" end="36.790">ピ</span><span begin="36.790" end="36.900">ア</span><span begin="36.900" end="37.195">ノ、</span><span begin="37.437" end="37.845">机</span><span begin="37.845" end="37.975">を</span><span begin="37.975" end="38.195">弾</span><span begin="38.195" end="38.287">く</span><span begin="38.287" end="38.435">癖</span><span begin="38.435" end="38.520">が</span><span begin="38.520" end="38.685">抜</span><span begin="38.685" end="38.790">け</span><span begin="38.790" end="39.027">な</span><span begin="39.027" end="39.270">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">理当放弃了的钢琴 却改不掉弹奏桌面的习惯</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ya me ta ha zu no pi a no, tsu ku e o hi ku ku se ga nu ke na i</span></p><p begin="39.270" end="41.401" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.270" end="39.401">ね</span><span begin="39.401" end="39.585">ぇ、</span><span begin="39.705" end="39.953">将</span><span begin="39.953" end="40.225">来</span><span begin="40.225" end="40.460">何</span><span begin="40.460" end="40.556">し</span><span begin="40.556" end="40.705">て</span><span begin="40.705" end="40.835">る</span><span begin="40.835" end="40.943">だ</span><span begin="40.943" end="41.089">ろ</span><span begin="41.089" end="41.197">う</span><span begin="41.197" end="41.401">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐，将来要做什么好呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nee, sho u ra i na ni shi te ru da ro u ne</span></p><p begin="41.690" end="43.442" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.690" end="41.922">音</span><span begin="41.922" end="42.148">楽</span><span begin="42.148" end="42.291">は</span><span begin="42.291" end="42.351">し</span><span begin="42.351" end="42.475">て</span><span begin="42.475" end="42.642">な</span><span begin="42.642" end="42.760">い</span><span begin="42.760" end="42.882">と</span><span begin="42.882" end="43.006">い</span><span begin="43.006" end="43.118">い</span><span begin="43.118" end="43.442">ね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要是不做音乐就好了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">on ga ku wa shi te na i to i i ne</span></p><p begin="45.249" end="46.540" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.249" end="45.503">困</span><span begin="45.503" end="45.640">ら</span><span begin="45.640" end="45.767">な</span><span begin="45.767" end="45.879">い</span><span begin="45.879" end="46.019">で</span><span begin="46.019" end="46.540">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要让我困扰啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko ma ra na i de yo</span></p><p begin="46.663" end="54.686" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.663" end="48.645">心</span><span begin="48.645" end="48.907">の</span><span begin="48.907" end="50.870">中</span><span begin="50.870" end="52.198">に</span><span begin="52.198" end="52.662">一</span><span begin="52.662" end="52.894">つ</span><span begin="52.894" end="53.296">線</span><span begin="53.296" end="53.612">を</span><span begin="53.612" end="53.921">引</span><span begin="53.921" end="54.171">い</span><span begin="54.171" end="54.411">て</span><span begin="54.411" end="54.686">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算与我隔开</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ko ko ro no na ka ni hi to tsu sen o hi i te mo</span></p><p begin="54.818" end="56.452" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.818" end="54.947">ど</span><span begin="54.947" end="55.085">う</span><span begin="55.085" end="55.210">し</span><span begin="55.210" end="55.336">て</span><span begin="55.336" end="55.432">も</span><span begin="55.432" end="55.586">消</span><span begin="55.586" end="55.693">え</span><span begin="55.693" end="55.850">な</span><span begin="55.850" end="55.964">か</span><span begin="55.964" end="56.098">っ</span><span begin="56.098" end="56.452">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它也依然不会消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">do u shi te mo ki e na ka tta</span></p><p begin="56.714" end="58.044" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.714" end="57.001">今</span><span begin="57.001" end="57.302">更</span><span begin="57.302" end="57.451">な</span><span begin="57.451" end="57.552">ん</span><span begin="57.552" end="57.688">だ</span><span begin="57.688" end="57.775">か</span><span begin="57.775" end="58.044">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">事到如今</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">i ma sa ra nan da ka ra</span></p><p begin="58.063" end="1:01.973" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.063" end="58.238">な</span><span begin="58.238" end="58.454">ぁ、</span><span begin="58.454" end="58.716">も</span><span begin="58.716" end="1:00.007">う</span><span begin="1:00.335" end="1:00.754">思</span><span begin="1:00.754" end="1:01.024">い</span><span begin="1:01.024" end="1:01.194">出</span><span begin="1:01.194" end="1:01.377">す</span><span begin="1:01.377" end="1:01.973">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂，别再回想了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">naa, mo u o mo i da su na</span></p><p begin="1:02.017" end="1:03.386" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.017" end="1:02.513">間</span><span begin="1:02.513" end="1:02.629">違</span><span begin="1:02.629" end="1:02.752">っ</span><span begin="1:02.752" end="1:02.917">て</span><span begin="1:02.917" end="1:03.084">る</span><span begin="1:03.084" end="1:03.184">ん</span><span begin="1:03.184" end="1:03.270">だ</span><span begin="1:03.270" end="1:03.386">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样错了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ma chi ga tte run da yo</span></p><p begin="1:03.386" end="1:04.246" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.386" end="1:03.530">わ</span><span begin="1:03.530" end="1:03.645">か</span><span begin="1:03.645" end="1:03.754">っ</span><span begin="1:03.754" end="1:03.892">て</span><span begin="1:03.892" end="1:04.024">な</span><span begin="1:04.024" end="1:04.119">い</span><span begin="1:04.119" end="1:04.246">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不懂嘛</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">wa ka tte na i yo</span></p><p begin="1:04.246" end="1:05.778" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.246" end="1:04.316">あ</span><span begin="1:04.316" end="1:04.465">ん</span><span begin="1:04.465" end="1:04.590">た</span><span begin="1:04.590" end="1:04.701">ら</span><span begin="1:04.701" end="1:04.889">人</span><span begin="1:04.889" end="1:05.222">間</span><span begin="1:05.222" end="1:05.778">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你们这些人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">an ta ra nin gen mo</span></p><p begin="1:05.913" end="1:09.782" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.913" end="1:06.133">本</span><span begin="1:06.133" end="1:06.279">当</span><span begin="1:06.279" end="1:06.413">も</span><span begin="1:06.413" end="1:06.646">愛</span><span begin="1:06.646" end="1:06.739">も</span><span begin="1:06.739" end="1:06.845">世</span><span begin="1:06.845" end="1:07.068">界</span><span begin="1:07.068" end="1:07.199">も</span><span begin="1:07.199" end="1:07.515">苦</span><span begin="1:07.515" end="1:07.616">し</span><span begin="1:07.616" end="1:07.691">さ</span><span begin="1:07.691" end="1:07.807">も</span><span begin="1:07.807" end="1:07.975">人</span><span begin="1:07.975" end="1:08.301">生</span><span begin="1:08.301" end="1:08.773">も</span><span begin="1:08.773" end="1:08.874">ど</span><span begin="1:08.874" end="1:09.087">う</span><span begin="1:09.087" end="1:09.189">で</span><span begin="1:09.189" end="1:09.245">も</span><span begin="1:09.245" end="1:09.401">い</span><span begin="1:09.401" end="1:09.513">い</span><span begin="1:09.513" end="1:09.782">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真相啊 爱啊 世界啊 痛苦啊 人生啊 怎么样都好啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hon to u mo a i mo se ka i mo ku ru shi sa mo jin se i mo do u de mo i i yo</span></p><p begin="1:09.799" end="1:13.361" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.799" end="1:10.187">正</span><span begin="1:10.187" end="1:10.402">し</span><span begin="1:10.402" end="1:10.504">い</span><span begin="1:10.504" end="1:10.600">か</span><span begin="1:10.600" end="1:10.737">ど</span><span begin="1:10.737" end="1:10.846">う</span><span begin="1:10.846" end="1:10.941">か</span><span begin="1:10.941" end="1:11.062">知</span><span begin="1:11.062" end="1:11.197">り</span><span begin="1:11.197" end="1:11.314">た</span><span begin="1:11.314" end="1:11.435">い</span><span begin="1:11.435" end="1:11.545">の</span><span begin="1:11.545" end="1:11.655">だ</span><span begin="1:11.655" end="1:11.756">っ</span><span begin="1:11.756" end="1:11.936">て</span><span begin="1:11.936" end="1:12.168">防</span><span begin="1:12.168" end="1:12.361">衛</span><span begin="1:12.361" end="1:12.599">本</span><span begin="1:12.599" end="1:12.834">能</span><span begin="1:12.834" end="1:13.361">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想知道是否正确只是防卫本能啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ta da shi i ka do u ka shi ri ta i no da tte bo u e i hon no u da</span></p><p begin="1:13.598" end="1:14.736" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.598" end="1:13.838">考</span><span begin="1:13.838" end="1:14.032">え</span><span begin="1:14.032" end="1:14.182">た</span><span begin="1:14.182" end="1:14.314">ん</span><span begin="1:14.314" end="1:14.736">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">思考过之后</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan ga e tan da</span></p><p begin="1:14.986" end="1:15.880" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.986" end="1:15.178">あ</span><span begin="1:15.178" end="1:15.284">ん</span><span begin="1:15.284" end="1:15.369">た</span><span begin="1:15.369" end="1:15.482">の</span><span begin="1:15.482" end="1:15.575">せ</span><span begin="1:15.575" end="1:15.748">い</span><span begin="1:15.748" end="1:15.880">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都是你的错啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">an ta no se i da</span></p><p begin="1:31.546" end="1:33.425" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.546" end="1:31.923">考</span><span begin="1:31.923" end="1:32.102">え</span><span begin="1:32.102" end="1:32.251">た</span><span begin="1:32.251" end="1:32.360">っ</span><span begin="1:32.360" end="1:32.459">て</span><span begin="1:32.459" end="1:32.565">わ</span><span begin="1:32.565" end="1:32.696">か</span><span begin="1:32.696" end="1:32.813">ら</span><span begin="1:32.813" end="1:32.947">な</span><span begin="1:32.947" end="1:33.084">い</span><span begin="1:33.084" end="1:33.425">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想过之后依然搞不懂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kan ga e ta tte wa ka ra na i ga</span></p><p begin="1:33.548" end="1:35.186" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.548" end="1:33.728">本</span><span begin="1:33.728" end="1:33.889">当</span><span begin="1:33.889" end="1:34.014">に</span><span begin="1:34.014" end="1